WEBVTT

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:42.990
You have zero messages.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:48.170
Ta-dah! No messages on my mobile phone, either!

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:52.500
That means it's yet another job I didn't get!

00:01:57.260 --> 00:02:01.510
I guess it really is impossible for me to get a normal job.

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:03.060
Plus I'm old...

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:06.560
Isn't any kind of job OK?

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:09.810
No! I want to send you to school!

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:12.820
You still haven't given up, huh.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:18.320
If I can be together with you, then... that's enough for me!

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:28.830
Episode 3: Tears

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:50.810
Kouga has had a strong sense of justice since he was a child,

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:54.270
and he longed to become an anime superhero.

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:58.990
The tools he used this time are still in a prototype stage,

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:03.820
but as a father, I'm proud of his bravery in carrying out the rescue,

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:06.080
allowing us to test them out!

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:12.500
You're wrong!

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:15.040
Jin's the one who saved that family.

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:16.960
It was the same on the day we met, too...

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:18.010
Turn the car around!

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:20.760
It's a purse snatcher! We need to catch him!

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:25.350
Oh, my bad, my bad.

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:28.680
So where's tonight's group dating party?

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:32.650
Idiot! Of course I have money.

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:39.690
I'm taking you to the police!

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:42.360
What did you say, kid?

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:45.240
You making me out to be some kind of criminal?!

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:04.430
Someone!

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:06.300
Please help.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:07.430
Take him to the police.

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:11.230
He's a purse snatcher!

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:15.770
Excuse me! L-Let me through!

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:18.900
My bag...

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:22.150
You guys got it?

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:23.770
Thank you!

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:25.130
You really saved me!

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:30.160
10,000 yen. A reward!

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:37.420
From the very start, we were looking at the same scene in different ways.

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:43.630
I saw the criminal, and you saw someone in danger...

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:47.330
Stop it!

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:49.180
Let go of Oba-san!

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.810
Zet woke up.

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:54.690
Yes. Let Kanzaki see it, too,

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:57.690
the moment of Zet's birth!

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:03.940
Jin.

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:05.950
Endure and wait.

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:09.990
And then learn of immense rage and sorrow.

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:15.460
When love controls your body, you'll become complete.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:20.590
Zet's precious object is my meal.

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.220
Is he awakening?

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:52.870
Zet!

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:54.750
However, his body's still white.

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:56.250
He's not fully complete yet!

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:00.750
The energy levels are amazing!

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:04.130
As expected, he surpasses the prototype!

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:21.020
What's the meaning of this?

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:23.520
There might be an error in the data.

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:24.650
Zet is...

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.650
Zet's weak!

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:28.400
I'll kill Zet!

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:53.550
You... Shut up!

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:15.780
A single blow...

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:18.120
Although his body's white, it's more than I expected.

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:26.380
He's looking.

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:29.880
Zet can't see us.

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:33.300
I know that. Even so...

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:36.010
Mr. Chairman, we have a problem!

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:38.890
The instant Zet defeated that prototype,

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:41.020
his power began falling rapidly.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:42.980
What?!

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:46.020
Zets cellular structure is unstable.

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:49.530
He'll fall apart at this rate.

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:52.030
Just like the prototype.

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:55.530
This is me?

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:58.240
I'm the same as that guy before?

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:10.010
Mr. Chairman!

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:12.970
What the hell is this...

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:15.760
You... Why?!

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:18.640
Why did you kill Oba-san?!

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:20.520
Jin... kun...

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:24.270
What is this?

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:29.730
Oba-san?

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:35.530
Oh, no! He's begun disintegrating!

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:38.620
In order to stop the disintegration...

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:45.540
...you must return Zet to a human form.

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:47.630
What should we do, Kanzaki?

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:50.130
Defeat a Player.

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:51.840
That's impossible.

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:53.630
There aren't any here anymore.

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.180
No, Mr. Chairman.

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:59.470
That woman is the same as a Player.

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:04.640
Zet instinctively sniffs out the existence of Players,

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:08.230
and the disintegration won't stop as long as a Player is still there.

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:11.230
The death of a Player will make Zet into a human.

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:14.740
Jin... kun...

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:26.250
You bastards! What did you do to Oba-san?!

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.500
It's impossible!

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.750
Zet can't kill that woman.

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:35.300
Why, Oba-san?

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:38.970
Why do you have the same scent as those monsters?

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:46.770
Return Oba-san... to the way she used to be!

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:50.520
Don't call me... Oba-san.

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:08.120
You bastard...

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:11.250
There are no longer any Players here.

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:13.460
It's all over.

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:20.390
Kanzaki... Are you laughing at us? Why?

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:23.140
It was you who killed Oba-san...

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:24.770
It's my...

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:29.020
Why?! Why did you kill her?!

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:30.650
...win!

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:32.900
It's unforgivable!

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:34.980
<b>It's my win, Amagi.</b>

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:35.900
I see! So that's what it was, Kanzaki?
<b>It's my win, Amagi.</b>

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:38.400
I see! So that's what it was, Kanzaki?

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:47.580
His cells are becoming 99.25% human.

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:50.040
Zet's disappeared.

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:54.500
Kanzaki had us dancing to his tune,

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:59.130
all for his wish to turn Zet into a human!

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:08.980
Um, can she get your autograph?

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:13.560
This girl is a huge fan of yours, Kouga-san!

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:15.190
Come on, Mayu!

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:21.990
Sorry, I can't give you my autograph.

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:26.080
What? Even though we waited for you...

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:27.650
So at least get a handshake!

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:29.250
Right, Mayu?

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:32.000
It's fine, already, I'm just causing Kouga-san trouble.

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.500
It's fine, if it's just a handshake.

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:36.840
You did it, Mayu!

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.840
Go on, shake his hand!

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:49.730
Alphas Blade!

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:57.150
Onii-chan?

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:02.360
I kept knocking, but...

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:03.780
Ah, sorry.

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:07.660
I heard that Jin-kun was released from the hospital.

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:09.950
Do you know where he went?

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:14.290
This is Jin-kun's.

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:15.540
I want to give it back.

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:19.880
I don't know, either.

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:27.010
Father is using the arson incident to make a profit for the company.

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:27.800
It's underhanded of him.

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:30.560
That's the kind of person he is...

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:35.480
Konoha, what was I seeing in Alphas?

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:38.360
Alphas defeats his enemies and saves people,

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:39.820
but I...

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:42.320
That's an anime, right?

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:46.320
Of course things work out well no matter what kind of pinch he's in.

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:50.410
You're wrong! Alphas is perfect!

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:51.580
If it were Alphas,

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:54.830
he would've saved that family <i>and</i> definitely catch the arsonist!

00:12:55.750 --> 00:13:00.840
Sorry, but... I don't like it when you talk like that.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:08.550
Konoha, you're the only one who understands the real me.

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:15.230
Things were better when the three of us, including Jin, were on patrol.

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:17.310
I believed in justice then.

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:21.820
Onii-chan, what is your "justice"?

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:27.070
To me, it just seems like you're looking for praise.

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:32.580
Sorry...

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:44.840
So you're finally showing yourselves?

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:51.180
Why did you kill Oba-san?!

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:55.430
Over anything else, the first thing
you're worried about is that woman?

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:56.690
What a nice kid.

00:13:56.980 --> 00:13:58.560
Don't fuck with me!

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:00.480
I'll kill you!

00:14:03.030 --> 00:14:05.940
Sorry for the rough treatment,

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:09.530
but I want you to stay quiet and listen to what I have to say.

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:27.470
The place we're going is a forgotten area...

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:31.970
...where the monsters that you encountered once lived.

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:37.480
There's a deep connection between you and those monsters.

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:38.440
Kanzaki as well.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:41.230
You know Jii-chan?

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:42.190
Who're you?

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:45.030
I'm Amagi Mitsugai,

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:48.200
one who wishes for the extermination of those monsters.

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:50.700
Amagi.

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:58.460
What a messed up place.

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:15.060
Do you have any recollection of that ring?

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:18.560
The ring on my left hand?

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:22.310
We call that "The Ring of Exposure"!

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:26.690
Their sizes are different, but your small ring has the same power.

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:28.610
The same power?

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:34.450
As you know, the monsters usually appear to be humans,

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:38.750
but they return to their original form
through a phenomenon called "reversion"!

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:45.090
The Ring of Exposure holds the power to make them forcibly revert...

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:46.630
...from their human form to that of a monster.

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:48.670
You know an awful lot.

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:51.760
Only to be expected! This is a facility that we created.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.390
And then those monsters were born here.

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:59.060
You're telling me you guys made those monsters?

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:04.400
So you're saying... Doesn't that make it
you who killed Oba-san and Jii-chan?!

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:06.130
I won't deny it,

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:07.480
but please listen!

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:11.400
You're our last hope to face them.

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:13.160
That has nothing to do with this.

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:14.780
What's this so-called "hope"?

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:19.120
I just thought of something even better than killing you.

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:21.580
Stop it!

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:22.910
Let him be.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:29.420
He's got abnormalities in his body,

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:32.170
and he probably doesn't have the strength to bite off his own tongue.

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:34.370
Look!

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:36.600
The Ring of Exposure is resonating.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:46.100
It's proof that even now, the mere .5% of Zet within him lives on strongly.

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:48.360
My chest... hurts!

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:09.750
I'm pissed... I didn't die.

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:13.720
The monsters were called Players,

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:17.550
and they killed one another in one-versus-one fights here.

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:20.510
Who started something that stupid?

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:24.560
The Amagi Corporation, my company.

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:28.230
We needed to obtain huge profits in just a short period of time,

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:31.530
so I gave my consent for this party of madness.

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:33.560
And they ran away?

00:17:33.560 --> 00:17:35.450
That's nice for you.

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:39.410
I said that you're our last hope.

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:41.540
Ever since that day, its been my deepest wish...

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:44.080
...to exterminate the Players and atone for what I've done.

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:48.670
Working with Kanzaki, one of those who developed the Players,

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:52.340
this time I created a hunter to counter them.

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:54.970
And that's you!

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:59.930
You're telling me, you and Jii-chan created me?!

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:03.350
Kanzaki is your father.

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:07.350
Unfortunately, Kanzaki and I had a dispute,

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:12.820
and he disappeared, wanting to raise you as a human!

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:18.740
As I thought, fate is inescapable.

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:22.080
You did well coming back to me, Zet.

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:26.660
I'm not Zet. I'm Kanzaki Jin!

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:28.500
Fate can go fuck off!

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:36.670
If Kawakami Akemi were to become a victim of the Players, who would protect her?

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:40.090
What do you mean?

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:49.190
Sorry! That one's sold out.

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:50.730
Then this one's fine.

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:52.860
Sorry about that. Here you go!

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:53.730
Thanks.

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:56.190
Thanks! Come again!

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:57.740
Oba-san!
Thanks! Come again!

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:02.660
The woman you saw being shot in that dream and the woman who appeared before you...

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:05.870
...were both fakes created by us.

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:07.870
Don't fuck with me!

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:09.620
Who's to say that's not a fake, too?

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:12.380
Don't go.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:15.380
From now on, you can't get close to humans.

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:18.260
As long as you're Zet,

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:22.390
there's a good possibility Players will cause harm to anyone close to you.

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:26.640
If she's important to you, you can't get in touch with her!

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:33.730
We have no one other than you that we can count on.

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:35.820
You play dirty...

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:54.040
Um...

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:58.670
You're the girl who went on patrol with Jin!

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:00.970
It's justice's little sister!

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:03.260
I thought it was you.

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:06.180
You're the one he saved, right?

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:10.430
Jin-kun was living with you...

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:14.310
And you were both looking for him the whole time!

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:16.650
You take this.

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:22.650
I think you are more likely to meet Jin than I am!

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:26.830
Jin really liked saving people, too!

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:35.040
Right now, you're both Zet and human.

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:38.210
Which path you follow is up to you.

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:42.130
Will you live as a human, as Kanzaki wished?

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:46.970
Or will you accept our wishes and fight against the Players?

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:52.770
If I become Zet, can I protect the people who are important to me?

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:56.520
You yourself have to become much stronger to do that.

00:20:56.520 --> 00:21:00.860
That white form is still incomplete.

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:04.240
Zet's complete form is red.

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:06.570
The reason I stirred up your heart like that...

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:08.870
...was because I wanted you to take that form.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:12.370
I have some conditions.

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:17.210
If you can make dolls like that,

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:19.380
you can make Oba-san's face beautiful again, right?

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.050
Understood.

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:22.130
And one more thing.

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:25.840
It seems like Oba-san has a kid.

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:29.390
Isn't there some way they can live together?

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:31.640
I'll do something.

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:34.180
You should write a letter to her as well.

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:35.890
Please put her at ease.

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:37.400
Right.

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:40.980
I accept all of your conditions.

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:43.650
Do you agree to become Zet?

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:47.280
Yeah, I'll become Zet!

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:49.280
Where do I start?

00:21:59.460 --> 00:22:02.050
I found something good.

00:22:10.090 --> 00:22:16.060
Your birthday comes,

00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:22.900
and I pick a present for you.

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:29.160
I stop my feet on fifth street.

00:22:29.160 --> 00:22:35.830
This love can't be changed.

00:22:38.410 --> 00:22:45.380
Darling, stop the clock, stop your head,

00:22:45.380 --> 00:22:51.220
stop your heart, your eyes and ears, and everything.

00:22:51.220 --> 00:22:58.060
Darling, all the words I received from you.

00:22:58.060 --> 00:23:09.490
Hugging you as if embracing a rose with no thorns.

00:23:09.490 --> 00:23:17.120
Darling, the miracle of the two of us meeting in this world.

00:23:17.120 --> 00:23:28.550
With only a trace of that, me loving you.

00:23:35.370 --> 00:23:36.520
Preview of Next Episode

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:37.310
Looks like the criminal is the Sandman.
Preview of Next Episode

00:23:37.310 --> 00:23:39.340
Looks like the criminal is the Sandman.

00:23:39.340 --> 00:23:41.810
